WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:02.252
(chuckles)

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:05.964
- I watch the Oscars because
of the fabulous dresses.

00:00:05.964 --> 00:00:08.383
(audience applauds)

00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:12.178
- I watch the Oscars to see
what shoes everyone is wearing

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:13.471
and who shows up.

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:14.305
- I'm always interested to see

00:00:14.305 --> 00:00:16.307
what people are gonna
wear on the red carpet.

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:19.686
- It is such an incredible thrill

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:23.565
when you see people glammed
up, having such a good time.

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:24.399
- I watch the Oscars

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:26.985
because it's the Super
Bowl for film nerds.

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:28.111
(men chuckle)

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:30.488
- I see it more as the
Super Bowl of culture.

00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:31.322
- Oh, I like it.

00:00:31.322 --> 00:00:34.034
- People are sweating,
and they're like nervous.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.452
It feels like real life.

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:37.120
- Every year, I see my friends,

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.998
we come together and
watch the Oscars together,

00:00:39.998 --> 00:00:41.833
and this is really fun.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:43.668
- I'm obsessed with watching the Oscars,

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:44.961
and I do it every year.

00:00:44.961 --> 00:00:47.422
And I live in Britain,
so I stay up all night.

00:00:47.422 --> 00:00:50.216
I can't miss it, and I love it. (laughs)

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:51.843
- They're the coolest show ever.

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:53.553
And now, I get to be a part of them,

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:55.680
which even makes it cooler for me.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:57.515
- It’s such a celebration

00:00:57.515 --> 00:00:59.934
for all we accomplish on a daily basis.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.144
- There you go.

00:01:01.144 --> 00:01:02.187
- There it is, it’s pretty good.

00:01:02.187 --> 00:01:03.271
-  It was great.

